      },
      "message": " You\",\"year\":2026,\"overview\":\"A woman answers a help wanted ad to be a housekeeper in a mysterious New York City high-rise, unaware that she is entering a community that has seen a number of disappearances over the years and may be under the grip of a Satanic cult.\",\"rating\":6.4,\"runtime_minutes\":94,\"content_rating\":\"R\",\"poster_path\":\"/6oI4oQKTWMVUlr8Ivqydp28Ruu6.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/qnTdOizsXBzYu3uIbfhHSfE29TE.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-28T10:09:24.353577Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-28T10:09:25.005149Z\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":8165,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"sort_title\":\"Hoppers\",\"year\":2026,\"overview\":\"Scientists have discovered how to \u0027hop\u0027 human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.\",\"rating\":7.6,\"runtime_minutes\":105,\"content_rating\":\"PG\",\"poster_path\":\"/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/u53UYu5XG2hNgWGvs3xGhAVzypl.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-28T10:09:06.052912Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-28T10:09:06.829643Z\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":8164,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Slanted\",\"sort_title\":\"Slanted\",\"year\":2026,\"overview\":\"An insecure Chinese-American teenager undergoes experimental surgery to appear white, hoping to secure the prom queen title and peer acceptance.\",\"rating\":6.5,\"runtime_minutes\":102,\"content_rating\":\"R\",\"poster_path\":\"/cr2SfN854IlEoZQBtIfpyC0zXR5.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/35coF6nTlCHZoBdmH7AJX47RwY9.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-27T22:09:16.085202Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-27T22:09:16.987919Z\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":8161,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"60 Dates in 6 Months\",\"sort_title\":\"60 Dates in 6 Months ()\",\"year\":2026,\"overview\":\"A widowed woman in her 50s, recovering from a neck injury, sets out to go on 60 dates in six months-facing bad matches, worse advice, and unexpected healing in her hilariously messy comeback to modern love.\",\"rating\":5,\"runtime_minutes\":94,\"poster_path\":\"/tbi8zwZjGh9CxT6R15xWEjvhxKP.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/3XPFa7nbpqumbkFAp6vE4ycMyRH.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-25T22:08:55.03182Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-25T22:09:01.689217Z\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":8146,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Bibleman: Jesus Our Savior\",\"sort_title\":\"Bibleman Jesus Our Savior\",\"year\":2002,\"overview\":\"In this combined feature of Jesus, Our Savior Parts 1 and 2, we are introduced to the most sinister, most evil villain, Primordious Drool. Drool knows he cannot win against Bibleman on is own and has a plan to fight our favorite superhero. He intends to make Bibleman fight against himself. Drool drives the citizens of Andersonville to trust in Bibleman instead of God. Bibleman faces is toughest challenge ever as he has to explain to the townspeople that they cannot look to him as a superhero to save them. They must look to God, for only God can answer their prayers.\",\"rating\":10,\"runtime_minutes\":75,\"content_rating\":\"PG\",\"poster_path\":\"/qNDdFHeRySSxdGPckD719lAkgmD.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/wwonZYonQVLnJSbk3ls9t6lkazl.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-19T01:59:08.70292Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-19T18:04:14.349162Z\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":8140,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Cocaine Bear\",\"sort_title\":\"Cocaine Bear\",\"year\":2023,\"overview\":\"Inspired by a true story, an oddball group of cops, criminals, tourists and teens converge in a Georgia forest where a 500-pound black bear goes on a murderous rampage after unintentionally ingesting cocaine.\",\"rating\":6,\"runtime_minutes\":95,\"content_rating\":\"R\",\"poster_path\":\"/gOnmaxHo0412UVr1QM5Nekv1xPi.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/a2tys4sD7xzVaogPntGsT1ypVoT.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-18T23:40:21.594036Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-18T2"
    },
