      },
      "message": "l are modelling again when an opposing company attempts to take them out from the business.\",\"rating\":4.9,\"runtime_minutes\":100,\"content_rating\":\"PG-13\",\"poster_path\":\"/n8AJzALlTPBwe9Tkv3tdxbiAr9i.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/4ANhwN1jr5EGwHS0M13AH5Fs3NH.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-08T03:56:37.519827Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-18T17:07:51.728089Z\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":2331,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Zoolander\",\"sort_title\":\"Zoolander\",\"year\":2001,\"overview\":\"Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1\u0027s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic Hansel scooters in to steal this year\u0027s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. It\u0027s a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories like Matilda can Derek make the world safe for male models everywhere.\",\"rating\":6.2,\"runtime_minutes\":89,\"content_rating\":\"PG-13\",\"poster_path\":\"/qdrbSneHZjJG2Dj0hhBxzzAo4HB.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/lIyyiBOuyokL82rPEDcZaMKleA3.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-08T03:56:37.519695Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-18T17:07:51.644782Z\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"file_path\":\"\"},{\"id\":2330,\"library_id\":1,\"type\":\"movie\",\"title\":\"Zookeeper\",\"sort_title\":\"Zookeeper\",\"year\":2011,\"overview\":\"Kindhearted Griffin Keyes is one of the best-loved caretakers at the Franklin Park Zoo, but he\u0027s more comfortable with the animals than with females of his own species as proven by his failed marriage proposal to the self-absorbed Stephanie several years ago. The animals have listened to Griffin pine over her for years and, after she reappears in his life, they decide to help Griffin rekindle the relationship and become the alpha male she wants him to be. They inadvertently reveal their secret ability to talk and, after Griffin\u0027s initial shock, teach him the rules of courtship, animal-style. Surprisingly, the animals\u0027 advice really works and Griffin is about to get everything he\u0027s ever dreamed of--or is he?\",\"rating\":5.4,\"runtime_minutes\":102,\"content_rating\":\"PG\",\"poster_path\":\"/y3b4AYw8dr4hIKTfEAjxUxx0z8G.jpg\",\"backdrop_path\":\"/rzTw6K1TbmF8qCUHWFrGhgXkBp5.jpg\",\"added_at\":\"2026-04-08T03:56:37.32553Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-18T17:07:51.462475Z\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"file_path\":\"\"}],\"page\":1,\"per_page\":20,\"total_items\":893,\"total_pages\":45}"
